\begin{cases}
5 - x = 10 \\
3 - y = 7
\end{cases}
\] Solving these equations, we get $x = -5$ and $y = -4$. So the coordinates of point $D$ is $(-5, -4)$. </think> <answer> $(-5, -4)</answer>

